Generic single-database configuration.

Almebic is basically git for your database

Whenever you create a new column or table run the following commands:

1. alembic revision --autogenerate -m "your message"
2. alembic upgrade head
3. alembic current (-- current migration version)
4. alembic history (-- migration history)
5. alembic downgrade (-- downgrade 1 migration)
6. alembic downgrade base (-- downgrade to base)